OL,3,GNEWSAMan's finger severed in park dog
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has had the tip of his finger
OL,7,Fsevered in a dog attack at a busy park.
OL,9,FNorthamptonshire Police said the man
OL,10,Fwas injured after being approached by a
OL,11,Fdog which bit his hand at Abington Park
OL,12,Fin Northampton between 12:30 and 13:30
OL,13,FBST on Saturday.
OL,15,FThe dog, which was off the lead but
OL,16,Fwearing a red collar, is described as
OL,17,Fbeing a large black Staffordshire bull
OL,18,Fterrier cross with a white chest.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
