OL,3,GNEWSAMan's finger severed in park dog
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force appealed for the dog's owner
OL,7,Fto come forward as a matter of urgency
OL,8,Fand anyone with information to help
OL,9,Fidentify the dog.
